 "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499311582_1316767993029891_4705637181230336969_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XB-F14PNUg8Q7kNvwEvubqJ&_nc_oc=AdoM5h-5-CAjthxXAlKn9HmrM8zkvlUs-KjRv79fbW8znWrJvwhwn8-rqBGQFqLqtWo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQH0oTTSfZvIcUyuAwScNiWdd4zuWeGmNby6axiBnyh_Gw&oe=6A733ADA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "491818860_908783172106325_4029656652719763094_n.png.png", "id": "1025157330261039", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499299772_1025157333594372_241466352877841963_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ejUwMoG8mqkQ7kNvwGDGYAW&_nc_oc=AdrOPhIrCcdWB7PcPjh1TSJvYHarB6Azl1noGDCdeUmcGpoCfmNkXneRUD3BQJFZSl4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGTmWDF7ZOu1bGjlCWtvaluOcj2LJiKR_XIPWI-_QpQDg&oe=6A73395E"}, "display_name": "Gorilla Game", "keywords": ["tag", "social", "multiplayer", "sandbox", "gorilla"], "long_description": "# Ready to go full monke?\n\n**Gorilla Game** is a free multiplayer VR movement game built around the simple, chaotic fun that made old-school VR so special.\n\nNo overcomplicated stuff, just climb, swing, fling, juke, tag, and laugh with friends in fast social lobbies.\n\n# Play your way\n\n**Sandbox** - mess around, practice movement, and build your own fun\n\n**Infection** - classic run-and-tag survival chaos\n\n**Zone Ball** - a gravity-filled team mode where players fight to score\n\n**Fireball** - blast other monkes in fast PvP chaos\n\n**Challenges** - push your parkour skills to the limit\n\n**Custom Maps** - explore player-made worlds or create your own\n\nJump into public lobbies, make a private room with friends, or build your own chaos.\n\n**Simple, Social, Nostalgic, And Ridiculously fun.**\n{1537559831290651}", "short_description": "A free multiplayer VR movement game where you climb, swing, juke, tag, and hang out with friends. Play chaotic mo